%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Three short stories, each tying a Function to the value it serves, in a stakeholder's own words. Why the guide waits, then tells both (OS-01). Why hints go to the relative (OS-02). Why the guide asks first (OS-03). Voices are provisional: written by the group, not yet heard from stakeholders.

= Objective Story - Tell us both [OS-01] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-01
|Name|Tell us both
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-03, HFC-06.
|Narrative|//Riet:// "At the counter I talked all day. Now a word goes, and the story goes with it. Give me a moment. If it doesn't come back, remind us both where I was, not just me."
|Concerns|F2 Keep the thread; HV-02 Dignity, HV-06 Social connectedness

= Objective Story - A word in my ear [OS-02] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-02
|Name|A word in my ear
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-04, HFC-08.
|Narrative|//Anne:// "The second telling of the dog story used to make me snap. Now I hear 'told before, the roses are out', and I ask about the roses. Jan agreed to the hints. I would never want them behind Jan's back."
|Concerns|F2 Keep the thread (hints on calls); HV-06 Social connectedness, HV-08 Truthfulness

= Objective Story - Not a dog [OS-03] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-03
|Name|Not a dog
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; VT-07.
|Narrative|//Jan:// "I'm not a dog to be walked. I go out to see Riet, or to talk to Anne. The thing asks, and if I say no, that's that."
|Concerns|F1 Ask first; HV-01 Autonomy, HV-02 Dignity

== Graph edges ==

OS-01: narrates → F2, HV-02, HV-06; serves → OBJ-01, OBJ-07.

OS-02: narrates → F2, HV-06, HV-08; serves → OBJ-01, OBJ-02.

OS-03: narrates → F1, HV-01, HV-02; serves → OBJ-06.
